{
  "Name": "Adobe Flash Player Drawing Fill Shader Memory Corruption",
  "Description": "This module exploits a memory corruption happening when applying a Shader as a drawing fill as exploited in the wild on June 2015. This module has been tested successfully on: Windows 7 SP1 (32-bit), IE11 and Adobe Flash 17.0.0.188, Windows 7 SP1 (32-bit), Firefox 38.0.5 and Adobe Flash 17.0.0.188, Windows 8.1, Firefox 38.0.5 and Adobe Flash 17.0.0.188, and Linux Mint \"Rebecca\" (32 bits), Firefox 33.0 and Adobe Flash 11.2.202.460.",
